  "details": "When creating an event, if a thumbnail is not selected, the discord embed will use the default \"no group image\" art instead of defaulting to the group's banner.\n\nThe same can be seen in incognito browser window, however the group's banner shows correctly if you are logged into the website.\n\nWith thumbnail selected: https://vrchat.com/home/group/grp_0e258f13-4557-4ee7-a2b9-3c996d0814c3/calendar/cal_e6e31b2b-ee89-48bc-b815-0aa5a89ac252\n\nWithOUT thumbnail selected: https://vrchat.com/home/group/grp_0e258f13-4557-4ee7-a2b9-3c996d0814c3/calendar/cal_9785ad82-ee41-4f21-8982-5856a76b8e05\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\n1. Create a group event with a thumbnail image selected\n\n2. Post the event link to a discord server (or visit it in incognito mode)\n\n3. See that the image is correctly displayed (expected behavior)\n\n4. Create a group event withOUT a thumbnail image selected\n\n5. Post the event link to a discord server (or visit it in incognito mode)\n\n6. See that the image is the default \"no group image\" image (unexpected behavior)",
